{"id":"n23410-1-9","stage":3,"title":"눈동자 · 眼珠","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23410-1-9-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 눈동자를 깜박거리니?","zh":"你怎么一直眨眼睛啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"눈동자를","meaning":"眼珠，瞳孔，眸子","explanation":"눈동자：眼珠，瞳孔，眸子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈동자","audio":"/audio/c18423b154a0917cea68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23410","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈동자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈동자를","audio":"/audio/25d38c2ff8f540ac09a1.mp3"}},{"text":"깜박거리니?","meaning":"眨巴，一眨一眨","explanation":"깜박거리다：眨巴，一眨一眨；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"깜박거리다","audio":"/audio/7ef241742b002444e712.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37726","senseId":"2","lemma":"깜박거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깜박거리니","audio":"/audio/a70bd23ff943c3022388.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c18423b154a0917c","term":"눈동자","zh":"眼珠，瞳孔，眸子","audio":"/audio/c18423b154a0917cea68.mp3","entryId":"23410","definition":"眼球中间的黑色部分。","pronunciation":["눈똥자"]},{"id":"7ef241742b002444","term":"깜박거리다","zh":"眨巴，一眨一眨","audio":"/audio/7ef241742b002444e712.mp3","entryId":"37726","definition":"眼睛频频地闭一会儿后再睁开；或使那样。","pronunciation":["깜박꺼리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cea02e5eb8c2b36da1b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23410-1-9-2","ko":"눈에 뭐가 들어간 것 같아서요.","zh":"我觉得眼睛里好像进了东西。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈에","audio":"/audio/07026b7029c6aacdf449.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"들어간","meaning":"包含，插入，夹进","explanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어간","audio":"/audio/58f73e66235f1c1ca913.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아서요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어서요：用礼貌语气补充理由：“因为……”。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아서요","audio":"/audio/5b3697e29c4c3ed0b318.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14